# ============================================================
# Command & Skill — list available slash-commands and skills.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4096

### List commands
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/command

### List skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skill

### List references (CLI flags, opencode instructions, docs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reference